{
    "version": "nightly",
    "description": "网易UU远程，提供低延迟远程连接与云游戏体验。",
    "homepage": "https://uuyc.163.com/",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "Proprietary",
        "url": "https://uuyc.163.com/"
    },
    "url": "https://a56.gdl.netease.com/UURemote_Setup_4.49.0.6162_1126083648_gwqd.exe?key1=a8089da39b6f5877c5af3961d2c0233d&key2=6b0999a0&n=uuyc_4.49.0.exe",
    "installer": {
        "script": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\*\\bin\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/uuyc/install.ps1'"
    },
    "post_install": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\*\\bin\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/uuyc/post_install.ps1'",
    "pre_uninstall": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\*\\bin\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/uuyc/pre_uninstall.ps1'",
    "uninstaller": {
        "script": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\*\\bin\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/uuyc/uninstall.ps1'"
    },
    "post_uninstall": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\*\\bin\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/uuyc/post_uninstall.ps1'",
    "bin": "GameViewer\\GameViewer.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "GameViewer\\GameViewer.exe",
            "UU远程"
        ]
    ],
    "notes": [
        "NSIS 静默：/S /NS /D=；网易安装器常忽略 /NS，post_install 会清掉非 Scoop Apps 的厂商快捷方式。",
        "GameViewerService 在 post_install 改绑到 apps\\uuyc\\current\\...（Junction，升级不拆服务名）。",
        "运行时：%LOCALAPPDATA%\\GameViewer → persist/AppData；%PROGRAMDATA%\\Netease\\GameViewer → persist/ProgramData（目录联接）。",
        "安装与卸载清理需管理员 PowerShell。",
        "manifest 为 nightly（无 hash）；官网 CDN 可能同址换包，与 dorado todesk / steam 同策略。"
    ]
}
